ser":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T00:49:12-07:00","id":1221962,"title":"","content":"In days long past I asked a similar question about Exandria in Exalted.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157228-kicking-in-another-world-s-door-beating-a-settings-arse-exalted-in-exandria\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157228-kicking-in-another-world-s-door-beating-a-settings-arse-exalted-in-exandria\"> Kicking in another World's Door Beating a Settings Arse: Exalted in Exandria - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157228-kicking-in-another-world-s-door-beating-a-settings-arse-exalted-in-exandria\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157228-kicking-in-another-world-s-door-beating-a-settings-arse-exalted-in-exandria </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So one of my favorite things is to make special realms often so I can have my players interact with themes or whole settings from other gamelines. My game is on hiatus before they went to Thedas, the setting of Dragon Age. But I am a fan of Critical Role (https://geekandsundry.com/shows/critical-role/) and I can't help but want sometime try to have a circle of Exalts wreck havoc on D&amp;amp;D. I was trying to think the best way to do this in my game. Perhaps one of the things I was contemplating was the idea of the Hannya being efficient direct predators surrounding the Raksha who fled to Creation to </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T05:54:03-07:00","id":1221999,"title":"","content":"I haven't watched Season 1 yet, so I'll just go with what I know best.<br /> <br /> Caleb feels pretty easily Twilight, probably Occult Supernal.<br /> Nott likewise feels like a pretty easy Night, Stealth or Larceny Supernal.<br /> Beau's a Dawn Martial Artist, Cobalt Soul Style.<br /> Jester... I'm not quite sure, honestly. She's a priestess of a trickster god, but does that make her more Zenith or Night? Or neither?<br /> Molly's also odd. I'm tempted to say Night given the conman thing, probably with lots of Occult given the whole Blood Hunter deal.<br /> Fjord, I feel, could be an Eclipse---he's a warlock (Occult), he's charismatic and often acts as the main face (Presence, Socialize), and he comes from a nautical background (Sail).<br /> Yasha is probably another Dawn, probably Melee.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T13:12:57-07:00","id":1222293,"title":"","content":"Molly is a bit of a con, but he's also the one who's most based around being a world traveler and being the talker of the group. So Molly is probably an eclipse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}